ongs", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sandales de plage form\u00e9es d'une semelle l\u00e9g\u00e8re et d'une bride en V", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Que penses-tu de ces tongs pour aller \u00e0 la plage&nbsp;?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "les sandales", "type": "name"}, {"content": "chaussures qui d\u00e9couvrent le dessus du pied", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : H\u00e9, ces sandales te vont tr\u00e8s bien&nbsp;!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "kitsch ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "de mauvais go\u00fbt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Choisis autre chose Coraline, celles-ci sont un peu kitsch&nbsp;!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "les sangles", "type": "name"}, {"content": "bande de toile ou de cuir qui sert \u00e0 maintenir quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Les sandales marron avec les sangles alors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le04ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Pr\u00e9parez un jeu de r\u00f4le. Il y a un employ\u00e9 et un client.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "D\u00e9cidez quel est le type de magasin.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez un dialogue (8 lignes). Le client pose des questions sur les prix et les produits.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Concluez le jeu de r\u00f4le avec une vente.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9changez vos r\u00f4les.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je pose